<title>UK: Chester Assets sets 240 mln stg seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Chester Assets sets 240 mln stg seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER    CHESTER ASSETS RECEIVABLES DEALINGS NO.4 LTD</p>
<p> AMT    240 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +8 BP     PAY DATE  S-24.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.0     FULL FEES   31 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.89</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC   11 BP</p>
<p> LEG MAT    15.SEP.06 - SCHEDULED MAT 15.JUL.04</p>
<p> NOTES    THIS IS THE 4TH SERIES OF NOTES BACKED BY ENTITLEMENT</p>
<p>	    TO CREDIT CARD RECEIVABLES ORIGINATED BY MBNA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
